tps://api.github.com/users/p-7/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-7/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-7/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-7/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-7/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/p-7/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-07T11:04:46Z","updated_at":"2025-12-07T11:04:46Z","body":"Unfortunately, I can't confirm for version 4.6 dev4 because:\n\nThe situation occurs when opening a project for the FIRST TIME (import?) from an older version of Godot to a newer one, \nwhere there is already a User Data Folder from the previous version.\n\nFor example, for version 4.6:\nIn [dev4] it works -> (change) -> first opening in: [dev5] -> freeze at 40% for a large project.\nIn [dev4] it works -> (change) -> first opening in: [dev6] -> 5 - 10 seconds, the project loaded.\n\nOnce a project is opened in a specific version, it works correctly. Thus, in the older dev4, loading is fast.\nI would have to delete the User Data Folder where the data and compiled shaders were located.\nIf I deleted it, I think it wouldn’t be the same.\n\nHowever, I didn't observe any issues between transitioning from: dev3 -> dev4, \nso we can assume there weren't any.\n\n I will keep an eye out if the problem happens again...","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3621918547/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3621938726","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113505#issuecomment-3621938726","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/